> > Hi Mickael,
> >
> > Thanks for the KIP.
> >
> > IIUC, the pushIntervalMs value passed via the context to exportMetri=
cs() is the _current_ push interval, right? OTOH, the payload parameter =
represents the data collected in the _previous_ push interval, right?
> >
> > I'm assuming this won't matter in practice, but I wanted to highligh=
t it.
> >
> > Thanks,
