> > those republished data occurs after the new leader has published metada=
ta
> > on newly accepted data, it will cause metadata to appear out of the
> offset
> > order. How does the follower know when to take vs ignore the metadata?
> > Could you document how the data flow works in all those cases with more
> > details in the KIP?
