Hi Christo,

Thanks for managing the release and for the proposed release plan.

Given our desire to ship every 4 months, I think the proposed dates should
be shifted a bit. The original plan was for 4.1 to ship in mid July and for
4.2 to ship in mid November. The former eventually shipped on September 2nd
and with the current plan would probably result in 4.2 shipping in late
January/early February. Given where we are, I would suggest something like:

KIP Freeze: October 29 (Wednesday)
Feature Freeze: November 19 (Wednesday)
Code Freeze: December 10 (Wednesday)
At least four weeks of stabilization will follow Code Freeze (taking
holidays into account), meaning we expect to release no earlier than
January 7 2026.

Ideally, we'd get RC0 out before the holiday break and then complete the
release by early/mid January.

Thoughts?

Ismael

