Hello,

we now understand the recently reported memory leak bug in Kafka Streams 
4.1.0, and have a PR to fix it.

https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19748

I consider this bug severe, as we expect that it affects a large number 
of Kafka Streams user, makes Kafka Streams unusable, and there is no 
workaround.

So I would like to propose to start 4.1.1 bug-fix release immediately, 
and also update the Kafka web page with a note that people should be 
careful and maybe not even upgrade to Kafka Streams 4.1.0.

Looking forward to your feedback.


-Matthias

