Hi Chia-Ping,

chia_04: Thanks for pointing that out. If I understand correctly, you=E2=80=
=99re
referring to the `--command-property` parameter? I notice not all
command-line tools support passing individual configs without a
configuration file, so this would be an extra parameter here. That said,
since this tool involves multiple clients (admin/producer/consumer), if you
feel it makes sense to add this parameter for consistency, I=E2=80=99m happ=
y to
open a follow-up PR.

Regards,

Nick

On Sun, Oct 5, 2025 at 2:01=E2=80=AFPM Chia-Ping Tsai <chia7712@apache.org>=
 wrote:

> hi Nick
>
> Sorry for raising issue on this voted KIP, but I have a small question.
