             Summary: Write down the steps for upgrading Gradle
                 Key: KAFKA-19756
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19756
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
            Reporter: Chia-Ping Tsai
            Assignee: Chia-Ping Tsai


Normally, we only update `gradle-wrapper.properties` and `dependencies.grad=
le`, but that process is incomplete. The correct steps are shown below.
 # upgrade gradle-wrapper.properties to the latest gradle
 # upgrade dependencies.gradle as well
 # use latest gradle to run command `gradle wrapper`to update gradlew=C2=A0
 # update wrapper.gradle to ensure the generated "download command" works w=
ell

=C2=A0



