> AbstractIndex#resize() does not release old mmap on Linux
> ---------------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-19390
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19390
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Bug
>          Components: core
