The primary goal is a reduction in cross-AZ data transfer costs for an
acceptable latency budget (~120ms with S3E1Z). You're right that for use
cases where higher latency is fine, Standard S3 is an excellent and cheaper
option, which is why we are adapting our design to support it as a user
choice alongside S3 Express One Zone.

