> > > metadata partition M-P1. This allows Broker B to subscribe to a singl=
e,
> > > predictable metadata partition, which drastically reduces its workloa=
d
> > and
> > > eliminates unnecessary network polling.
> > >
> > > Additionally, the metadata partition count (defaults to 50) should be
> > > increased such that each broker only needs to listen to at most one
> > > partition on average. This will also help reduce fan out.
