Hello,

Based on the previous discussion, here is a proposal of release plan for
4.1.1

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/Release+Plan+4.1.1

Aiming for code freeze in a week from now, mainly to allow time to
investigate the Connect  issue Mickael shared (
https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19758), but still be able to
ship this release as soon as possible. Note that there is also an open
blocker but has a PR in review (I will follow-up with them)

Let's wait to hear from Mickael, and we can adjust the target date if
needed. Let me know if you have any thoughts in the meantime.

Thanks!

Lianet


