>
> But I understand that it's a critical issue for Connect, so I agree that
> it would be great to get into 4.1.1. (Or as a last resort, so a quick
> 4.1.2 after you figured out a fix, in case you need more time...)
>
>
> @Lianet: Thanks for volunteering to be the RM! Can you prepare a release
> plan?
>
>
> -Matthias
