users, but agree that it's out of our reach given the code structure we
currently have.
I would suggest we add a note to the KIP alternatives about the sealed
approach Chia suggested, that surely would be 2nd best imo. We can't at the
moment but will surely be a nice follow-up to this KIP whenever we get to
j17.

+1 from me (binding)

Thanks!
Lianet


