Bill Bejeck resolved KAFKA-19747.
---------------------------------
    Fix Version/s: 4.0.2
                   4.1.1
       Resolution: Fixed

> Improve handling of failed push telemetry request
> -------------------------------------------------
>
>                 Key: KAFKA-19747
>                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19747
>             Project: Kafka
>          Issue Type: Improvement
>          Components: clients
>            Reporter: Bill Bejeck
>            Assignee: Bill Bejeck
>            Priority: Major
>             Fix For: 4.2.0, 4.0.2, 4.1.1
>
>
> When a failure occurs with a push telemetry request, any exception is treated as fatal, causing telemetry to be turned off.  We can enhance this error handling to check if the exception is a transient one with expected recovery, and not turn off telemetry in those cases.



--
