Hi Apoorv,
Thanks for the feedback. I have incorporated all changes.
AM1: Fixed references to AcknowledgeType.

AM2: Defined the new exception clearly.

AM3: There is no special handling for RENEW error cases. If record state is
not ACQUIRED, the broker should return record state errors which should be
received by share consumer and then notified to the app by the commit
callback. I have added a few lines on this front

AM4: Have clarified that old brokers already handle this scenario
gracefully.

Regards,
Sushant Mahajan

