Nikita Shupletsov created KAFKA-19793:
-----------------------------------------

             Summary: Disable topic autocreation for streams consumers.
                 Key: KAFKA-19793
                 URL: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19793
             Project: Kafka
          Issue Type: Improvement
          Components: streams
            Reporter: Nikita Shupletsov


Currently we disable it only for [the main consumer|[https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/trunk/streams/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/streams/StreamsConfig.java#L1793]]:

but not for [the restore|[https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/trunk/streams/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/streams/StreamsConfig.java#L1832]] or [global|[https://github.com/apache/kafka/blob/trunk/streams/src/main/java/org/apache/kafka/streams/StreamsConfig.java#L1865]] consumers



