>> https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1222%3A+Acquisitio=
n+lock+timeout+renewal+in+share+consumer+explicit+mode
>> > > >
>> > > > Regards,
>> > > > Sushant Mahajan
