Hi,

Thanks Fede for the feedback!

I was going to keep PrincipalConnectorClientConfigOverridePolicy but
after taking another look I think we can also deprecate it and mark it
for deletion.
Principal has been a source of security issues and it's not really
serving its purpose of allowing sasl configurations as we did not
update it to support the new configs we added.

Thanks,
Mickael



