> > >
> > > In classic Kafka topics, batch data and metadata are blended toget=
her in
> > > the one partition log. The crux of the Diskless idea is to decoupl=
e them
> > > and move data to the remote storage, while keeping metadata somewh=
ere else.
> > > Using the central batch coordinator for managing batch metadata is=
 one way,
