n
> ApiVersions to discover the supported versions and automatically select t=
he
> appropriate one. This is what we usually do for inter-broker communicatio=
n
> (e.g. AddPartitionsToTxnManager). Is this perhaps what you meant?
>
> Thanks,
> David
