Hi all,

I would like to initiate a vote for KIP-1227. This is one tiny change with
low risk.

Summary:
Expose rackId in MemberDescription and ShareMemberDescription to improve
observability, help analyze rack-aware distribution, and bring better
consistency with other APIs (like Streams=E2=80=99 group descriptions). It =
is
backward compatible and new field is optional.

KIP WIKI:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1227%3A+Expose+Rack+I=
D+in+MemberDescription+and+ShareMemberDescription
Discussion Thread:
https://lists.apache.org/thread/0jt1jfnm7z99smf451yrrld3pp326q4h
PR: https://github.com/apache/kafka/pull/20691

Thanks!

Regards
Jian

