> > > > design (after all previous discussions). Such things as local segme=
nt
> > > > materialization by replicas, the consume path, tiered storage
> > integration,
> > > > etc.
> > > >
> > > > If the community finds this design more suitable, we will update th=
e
> > > > KIP(s) accordingly and continue working on it. Please let us know
