Hi all,

I would like to start a discussion on
KIP-1231: Deprecate '--max-partition-memory-bytes' option in ConsoleProducer

https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1231%3A+Deprecate+%27--max-partition-memory-bytes%27+option+in+ConsoleProducer

This proposal consolidates the command options of ConsoleProducer by
deprecating the redundant --max-partition-memory-bytes in favor of the more
intuitive --batch-size.


Best,
Ming-Yen

