Subject: [VOTE] KIP-1188: New ConnectorClientConfigOverridePolicy with
 allowlist of configurations
To: dev <dev@kafka.apache.org>
Content-Type: text/plain; charset="UTF-8"

Hi,

I'd like to start a vote on KIP-1188:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/x/2IkvFg

It introduces a new ConnectorClientConfigOverridePolicy implementation
for Kafka Connect to enable users to selectively allow specific client
configuration overrides.

Such a policy would help address the several security issues that have
affected Connect and make Connect more secure by default.

Thanks,
Mickael

