hi Gaurav

Thanks for this KIP. I have two small questions:

chia_00: Have you considered using
`kafka.metrics.deprecated.requests.tag.user.enabled` since the new tag is
"users" rather than "principal"

chia_01:  Could you please add the discussion thread to the KIP?

Best,
Chia-Ping



