Hi,

I'd like to start a vote on KIP-1226
KIP Wiki:
https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-1226%3A+Introducing+Share+Partition+Lag+Persistence+and+Retrieval

JIRA: https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-19778

It introduces share partition lag to provide fine-grained visibility
into the consumption progress of share groups. This would help operators to
monitor share group behaviour more effectively and make informed
operational decisions.

Thanks,
Chirag

--000000000000db46ce0641bc0d98--

