* Maven artifacts to be voted upon:
https://repository.apache.org/content/groups/staging/org/apache/kafka/

* Javadoc:
https://dist.apache.org/repos/dist/dev/kafka/4.1.1-rc0/javadoc/

* Tag to be voted upon (off 4.1 branch) is the 4.1.1 tag:
https://github.com/apache/kafka/releases/tag/4.1.1-rc0

* Documentation:
https://kafka.apache.org/41/documentation.html

* Protocol:
https://kafka.apache.org/41/protocol.html

*CI builds for the 4.1 branch:
