Hi Jonah,

Thanks for noticing this. Unfortunately, if we wanted to fix this
limitation, we would need a KIP and update the version of any
message/rpc that want's to remove this length limitation on compact
strings.

I do find it inconsistent that the Kafka protocol enforces a length
limit of 32kb on compact strings but it doesn't enforce a length limit
on compact bytes.

Thanks,
--=20
-Jos=C3=A9

